  "path": "backlog/tasks/task-2.21 - Harden-the-end-paused-session-path-in-transaction-recheck-focus-after-failure-early-open-test.md",
  "description": "Follow-up from TASK-2.7 (doc-123). (1) ended() checks 'already ended' only before its write transaction; an ended record with a missing report could get a new endedAt if another tab ends it in that gap (security MINOR ended-no-recheck-in-transaction). (2) After ending the confirmed session fails, the dialog is removed without returning focus to Start game (code MINOR, judge J-1-01). (3) The SPEC-08 e2e would still pass if the Table opened before the end finished, because hand 1's write recreates the deleted start record (code MINOR).",
  "dependencies": [
    "TASK-2.7"
